        answer: "Early users went from 8 Instagram breaks per study session to maybe 1. The angry reaction turns one more scroll into a tiny moment of accountability. Try it free — no account needed."
      },
      {
        keywords: ["offline", "no internet", "no wifi", "airplane mode", "works without internet"],
        mood: "cheerful",
        answer: "Core blocking and session behavior works offline. No live network connection required."
